    10	Methods (stated, so the numbers can be compared):
    11	- SNM: Seevinck's butterfly. The two half cells (inverter + access transistor) are separate
    12	  instances driven by one swept input (DC, 5 mV steps). Hold: WL 0, bit lines at VDD. Read: WL at
    13	  VWL, both bit lines clamped at VBL (the usual worst case: a precharged bit line that has not yet
